{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"{\n  \"when\": {\n    \"always\": true\n  },\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"workflowInput\": {\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"GPT-6.1 Solのみを使用し、執筆と2つの査読を別の役割・セッションで実施する。未解決high\/middleは0とし、異種モデルの独立性は主張しない。ラウンド上限を合格にしない。\",\n        \"未知の任意表で数%精度や本番無影響を無条件に保証しない。参考統計・条件付き確率推定・正確COUNTを区別し、精度と予算と後始末を別判定する\",\n        \"暗号化され内容不明の50〜100列表に具体的な経路と根拠を示す。TDEと列暗号化を区別する\",\n        \"cache\/index\/暗号化\/条件漏れ\/検証不備の査読を含め、主要結論ごとに根拠の適用範囲を確認する\",\n        \"本文数値はハッシュ付きの保持されたresults\/reference配下へ対応。実験完了・精度達成・SLO合格を区別する\",\n        \"固定runnerが白紙DBからのmise run allを実施し、文書反映後に所有者が結果の意味と最終計測ソースの不変性を監査する。reproductionProofPathが無い間は完了としない\",\n        \"Latest user accepts about10% when few-percent is costly: compare3\/5\/10% accuracy-cost frontiers and exactCOUNT, show how conditions improve or worsen accuracy, and recommend methods under explicit error\/freshness\/service budgets.\"\n      ],\n      \"accuracyFrontierExistingEvidencePath\": \"results\/reviews\/accuracy-frontier-existing-evidence.json\",\n      \"additionalExperimentRequired\": {\n        \"budget\": \"必要なら仮説を変えず複数scriptへ分割。timeout\/guardの部分結果を完走としない。追加・変更したコードのセルフチェックも更新する。\",\n        \"coverage\": \"少なくとも100列TDEについて、小さい索引があればexact COUNTが勝つ条件と、索引なしでbounded samplingが負荷\/読取量を減らせるか、索引更新で何が変わるかを確認する。service負荷なしの精度\/コスト比較とservice負荷中の診断を区別する。\",\n        \"currentImplementation\": \"01a\/01b completed successfully;24-file immutable source\/results snapshot is at wideSamplingSnapshotPath. Remaining original0h-0l run serially under current owner. Latest accuracy-cost01c\/01d are already prepared and root-fixed for review001\/002; see latestAccuracySteering and assessment. Do not duplicate.\",\n        \"implementation\": \"01a\/01b completed successfully;24-file immutable source\/results snapshot is at wideSamplingSnapshotPath. Remaining original0h-0l run serially under current owner. Latest accuracy-cost01c\/01d are already prepared and root-fixed for review001\/002; see latestAccuracySteering and assessment. Do not duplicate.\",\n        \"protocol\": \"順序交替、対照、warmup\/回復の明示、actual method区間と広いtrialの区別、予定数保存則・unfinished\/censoredを保存。固定乱数は再現用であり本番信頼度の根拠ではない。ホストcacheは未制御。短窓からSLO合格や無影響を認定しない。\",\n        \"purpose\": \"確率的推定を50\/100列表という実対象へ対応させる。同じコードで整数PK・TDE・小さい索引有無・indexed\/nonindexed UPDATEを比較し、精度とコストと負荷を別判定する。\"\n      },\n      \"capacityMaintenanceEvidencePath\": \"results\/reviews\/build-cache-cleanup-evidence.json\",\n      \"completionAuditPath\": \"results\/reviews\/pre-final-audit.json\",\n      \"constraints\": [\n        \"実データベース接続禁止。Composeのprimary\/replicaとLabが起動するmatrixサーバーだけ\",\n        \"table dataをコミットしない。測定JSONを捏造・書換えしない\",\n        \"人が読む主文書は日本語・220行以内。詳細は分離したまま維持\",\n        \"commit\/pushはワークフローから実施しない\",\n        \"測定と別の実験を重ねない。固定runnerと.lab.lockを使う\",\n        \"フィールドcold\/warmはキャッシュ同等性を意味しない。暗号化の一律倍率を結論にしない\",\n        \"有限ラボで実施不能な本番条件は未計測と適用制限を明記し、無意味な追加実験を要求しない\"\n      ],\n      \"currentEvidence\": [\n        \"Latest source is Sol author18, integrated through19 and now phase17 documentation-only integration after an intentional stop. Source repairs are needed only for confirmed SOL-WIDE-ERROR001\/002; no observed live wide failure is claimed.\",\n        \"Actual WHITE attempt4 started2026-11-07T06:33:58Z underRuby4.0.9, passed resource preflight and12selfchecks, generated\/verified initial data and replica, completed58shapes\/99lock cases and8impact files before controlled interruption. It is NOT final reproduction. Wide\/requested phase was not reached.\",\n        \"Read results\/reviews\/wide-errors-interruption.json and sol-wide-errors-review.json\/assessment.json. Middle2 are confirmed exact-function\/fake counterexamples: service errors omitted from failure\/reuse decision, and defaultFalse workload server confirmation before next wide arm.\",\n        \"Root paused orchestrator, SIGINT exact bench Python, stopped only owned compose primary\/replica cleanly(exit0), confirmed no bench Python, then orchestratorSIGINT130. Data files retained; MEMORY is volatile. Final data integrity was not reached, not falsely approved.\",\n        \"VM capacity is resolved without lowering2GiBreserve. Unused publicSwift6.2SDKcache removed after exact registry digest resolved and zero container references; MySQL5 and currentbenchimages preserved. Last actual preflight VM6.4GiBfree\/host sufficient. Do not prune caches or alter Docker\/runtime for this repair.\",\n        \"All prior reqmix partitioned-v3 outcome\/cleanup\/fail-fast changes,150requested scripts,41write-mix plan with112main opportunities+aux\/tail,30scale plan,105accuracy\/48service scope and source\/raw\/cache\/freshness\/Ruby\/resource fixes remain required. No math\/SQL\/cap\/fixture changes merely to pass.\",\n        \"Registry now33unique reviewer IDs,41occurrences;all final closures pending. Six focused Sol reviews are prior evidence. Only two fresh final proof-based Sol roles can close high\/middle after successful all and owner audit.\"\n      ],\n      \"currentRevision\": 20,\n      \"detailPaths\": [\n        \"docs\/table-count-evidence.md\",\n        \"docs\/probability-count.md\"\n      ],\n      \"environmentRetryEvidencePath\": \"results\/reviews\/space-retry-evidence.json\",\n      \"findingRegisterPath\": \"results\/reviews\/finding-register.json\",\n      \"fixes\": [\n        {\n          \"boundedRemediation\": \"callerの失敗集計・保存・終了判定を限定修正する。失敗結果を保存して非0終了する方式、または診断完了を維持しつつ必須範囲の再利用を明示的に禁止する方式で足りる。precision_not_reached、全体budget_exhausted、確認済みdeadlineを一律失敗へ変更しない。既存の失敗観測は診断として保持し、成功比較から除外できるが、必須条件を満たしたことには代用できない。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-wide-errors-review.json\",\n          \"id\": \"SOL-WIDE-ERROR-001\",\n          \"requiredCorrection\": \"staticとserviceの双方について、期待された観測と予期しない失敗を区別して保存する。未解決の予期しない失敗を必須範囲の再利用可能な完了として扱わない。\",\n          \"severity\": \"middle\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"boundedRemediation\": \"既存のWorkload.finish(confirm_server=True)と所有connection確認機構を利用し、失敗時にも現在のarm情報・到着会計・cleanup診断をcallerへ保存してから停止する。後始末失敗を単なる遅延観測へ変換しない。SQL、caps、fixture、arm数の変更は不要。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-wide-errors-review.json\",\n          \"id\": \"SOL-WIDE-ERROR-002\",\n          \"requiredCorrection\": \"各wide armの所有workloadについて終了確認を行い、確認できない場合は後続比較を開始しない。accounting、打切り観測、cleanup結果を別々に保存する。\",\n          \"severity\": \"middle\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"frontierDesignReview\": {\n        \"assessmentPath\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-frontier-assessment.json\",\n        \"log\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-frontier-run.log\",\n        \"resultPath\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-frontier-review.json\",\n        \"snapshot\": \"results\/reference\/20261107-frontier-design\",\n        \"status\": \"completed,rejected middle3\/low1 on immutable pre-fix design\",\n        \"workflow\": \"temp-table-count-frontier-sol\"\n      },\n      \"guidelinePath\": \"docs\/table-count-guideline.md\",\n      \"historicalCurrentEvidence\": [\n        \"Interrupted white-all attempt2 actually used Ruby4.0.9, passed10self-checks, verified generated data\/replica, completed58shapes,99lock cases,36impact experiments and5matrix versions. It was deliberately stopped during01a because new high2\/middle1 protocol defects require source changes. Exit130 is intentional, not a Ruby\/bootstrap or DB failure. This is NOT final reproduction.\",\n        \"Read results\/reviews\/white-all-interruption.json and the immutable results\/reference\/review-20261107T053954Z-72116\/manifest.json. 01a is partial; later requested scripts were not run in this attempt. The source stayed unchanged during attempt2; no final proof exists.\",\n        \"Read the new results\/reviews\/sol-protocol-review.json and owner assessment. The findings are static counterexamples, not an assertion that current-run reqmix hit2013. Repair classification, necessary repetition budgeting and cleanup; preserve hypotheses.\",\n        \"All5pinned images are now downloaded. Docker VM filled during image pulls. Root removed only confirmed unused build caches; VM now has2.6GiB free, host142GiB. No images, containers, volumes or DB data were deleted for space. Read build-cache-cleanup-evidence.json; prepare images\/check space before performance in future.\",\n        \"The original31finding register and five focused Sol reviews remain pending final closure. Original Opus records are historical only; all new agents must be GPT-6.1 Sol.\",\n        \"Keep prior runtime selection, lossless8MiB raw chunks, artifact\/cache hashes, fresh-summary attribution, partitioned scale30scripts and tolerance105static\/48service scope. The current requested glob has118scripts before this repair; derive final scope from source.\",\n        \"LATEST environment-only retry: source unchanged through completed integration revision19. See space-retry-evidence.json. Current VMfreeKiB=6710280. Prior preflight failure is NOT DB\/measurement failure; final all still required. Use current prepared image\/cache without further cleanup during measurements.\"\n      ],\n      \"latestAccuracySteering\": {\n        \"additionalServicePriority\": \"Because actual100-column3%-target sampling exhausted the1s service budget in all6 no-small-index arms, include a minimal bounded100-column TDE under-load comparison at relaxed10% (plus matched control and existing3% evidence). Test whether reduced draws actually improve budget\/precision outcomes, rather than infer from static checkpoints.5% can be static if a full service factorial would add little. Split scripts within20min limits; avoid an exhaustive redundant factorial.\",\n        \"conditionMechanisms\": \"Distinguish effects on statistical accuracy, cost under a fixed budget, and freshness. Key-space sparsity\/cell-density variance affect sampling interval convergence; page-level row-size\/density heterogeneity, stats sample pages and staleness affect metadata error. A small index, cache, TDE, row width and MVCC mainly change read\/CPU\/time cost and therefore attainable precision within a fixed budget; they do not make a completed snapshotCOUNT approximate. Concurrent writes\/replica lag can change the represented time\/population and must not be conflated with estimator error. More sample pages\/ANALYZE does not guarantee monotonic accuracy and has separate maintenance impact.\",\n        \"implementation\": \"Root added isolated bench\/accuracy_frontier.py plus01c-ACCURACY-COST and01d-ACCURACY-SERVICE-100 (.versions8.4.13\/.encrypted\/.outputs). No active imported source was edited. Code is prepared, NOT DB-executed. Review\/fix these scripts rather than duplicate.01c uses seven fixtures xfive seeds x3targets, fullCOUNT paired comparisons, target-specific predeclared looks and same alpha.01d uses100-column TDE with control\/exact\/3%\/10%, index absent\/present, indexed\/nonindexed writes x3repeats=48arms.5% service is explicitly unmeasured; static includes it. Pure arithmetic verifies each first look can meet its target at zero variance; static closure includes new module and sampling dependencies. Both new wrappers honor the review-only aggregate guard (exit3, never success) and declare their required .outputs. Final all has no aggregate cap.\",\n        \"interpretation\": \"Compare accuracy, elapsed time, read volume and service impact rather than require only3%. Include exactCOUNT at0% error. Choose the most favorable method within the accepted error, freshness and service budget;10% is not an unconditional guarantee for arbitrary unknown tables.\",\n        \"newExperiment\": \"Review and run the isolated implementation named in implementation after the current owner ends. Retain hypotheses and proper confidence\/look allocation. Repair demonstrated issues or split if20min is insufficient; do not duplicate experiments or infer unobserved service effects.\",\n        \"reporting\": \"Give a compact condition-by-method comparison with accuracy\/freshness\/cost\/limi