9 scripts succeeded. Main change: FORCE INDEX (PRIMARY) moved from rejected to conditional, because under scattered writes the secondary-index statement hit its 120 s limit in 4\/4 runs while PRIMARY finished 8\/8. Under writes that do not touch the index, the earlier result stands. Also: the default parallelism is kept for PK-only tables, a client timeout does not stop the server statement, the ENUM guard, replica STOP failure and channel gate are measured, type results now cover all 5 versions, and the catalog is re-based on the re-run of script 10. New low finding: the step ceiling stops shrunken walks early. Reviewers decide closure.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 10,\n        \"role\": \"opus\",\n        \"summary\": \"Rejected. The write-mix redesign is good, its numbers match, and FIND-O6-WRITE-SHAPE-01 closes. Two middle items replace it. FIND-O10-PRIMARY-SCALE answers the author's question: no, adopting FORCE PRIMARY is not shown beyond a 2 GB table near lab saturation, and at 100 writes\/s the fixed tolerance is not met against k. FIND-O10-INDEXED-100-STALL: an unexplained 66.8 s split and a whole-run write p95 of 1646.57 ms at 100 writes\/s are missing from the text. On 91: encrypted results now exist from a run outside this workflow, so §11 is stale; I would not make them decisive, since encrypted tables are out of scope, but the owner should decide and confirm that run is finished. Scripts 90, 91 and 92 are still of unknown origin to me.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 10,\n        \"role\": \"sol\",\n        \"summary\": \"Rejected。digest一致。新しいwrite-mixの実行と数値、現行カタログ51表一致、全5版の型、ENUM guard、複数チャネル拒否、1205を独立確認した。Opusのmiddle 2件を確認し、低い速度でのPRIMARY優位の表示も訂正が必要とした。STOP失敗はgrace内の復旧しか測っておらず、現行restore_applierが停止を観測しないままrestored=trueを返すためFIND-S8-REPLICA-STOP-FAILURE-01を再開した。公式文書の裏付けは前回と今回のSol原文確認で成立しFIND-DOC-01は閉鎖。後発manual-91の完結成功ログは確認したが、実行所有者や別PIDの現在状態は断定しない。DB接続・変更・委譲はしていない。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 13,\n        \"role\": \"preserved-review-history\",\n        \"summary\": \"現在のSol rollout\/sampling\/validation\/frontier査読と28件の統合台帳を引き継ぐ。旧Opus記録は履歴だけで、新規承認は要求しない。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/finding-register.json\", \"results\/reviews\/author-revision14-preserved-reviews.json\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 14,\n        \"role\": \"author\",\n        \"summary\": \"DB接続・実験・テスト実行・委譲・別workflow起動なし。旧所有者中断ログと解放済みlockを確認後、reqscaleを30本へ分割して各方式3反復と300\/150秒上限を維持。旧3e\/3fをSHA付き引退台帳へ移し、matrix撤去・無効lock観測・semantic exitを修正。主文書206行。white-all、文書反映後監査、最終proofと別Sol査読は未完了。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/author-revision14-verification.json\", \"bench\/requested\/primary-scale-plan.json\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 15,\n        \"role\": \"integrate\",\n        \"summary\": \"白紙allはRuby構文解析でexit1、実験未到達。DB接続・Docker操作・実験・セルフテスト・委譲なし。全結果・ログ・statusとmanifestを照合し、旧結果の同梱を新規測定と区別。日本語主文書216行に静的な索引有無の逆転と予算到達を反映。全指摘・要求の状態と方法論監査を詳細へ分離。計測ソース255件のSHAは不変。Ruby選択修正は次authorへ引継ぎ、proof・査読閉鎖は未完了。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"docs\/table-count-integration-audit.md\", \"docs\/table-count-integration-files.md\", \"results\/reviews\/integrate-revision15-verification.log\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 16,\n        \"role\": \"author\",\n        \"summary\": \"Verified existing Ruby 4.0.9 bootstrap, added mise cache dependency and runtime logs; added lossless bounded raw chunks with nested artifact\/cache\/snapshot coverage; excluded stale summaries and retained previous attempts. Foreground pure regressions pass after correcting one macOS cwd alias assertion; failed test log retained. No DB\/Docker\/measurement\/delegation\/other workflow\/commit\/push. Original primary-scale and 105 static\/48 service scopes unchanged. White-all, semantic\/source owner audit, proof and two fresh Sol reviews remain pending.\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/author-revision16-verification.json\", \"results\/reviews\/author-revision16-protocol-preservation.json\", \"docs\/table-count-author-repair.md\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 17,\n        \"role\": \"integrate\",\n        \"summary\": \"Author16の後に固定runnerが白紙allを実行。Ruby4.0.9起動・初期COUNT検証・self_checks・基本実験・ENUMは到達。Sol設計査読のhigh2\/middle1を受け所有者が01a途中で中断(exit130)。最終データ検証なし、lab_data_intact=false、proofなし。文書だけ更新し、部分01aを成功根拠に使わず、reqmix2の分類・反復・終了確認を未解決として引継ぐ。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/white-all-interruption.json\", \"results\/reference\/review-20261107T053954Z-72116\/manifest.json\", \"docs\/table-count-integration-audit.md\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 18,\n        \"role\": \"author\",\n        \"summary\": \"Solのみ。DB接続・Docker操作・測定・委譲・別workflow起動・commit\/pushなし。失敗分類、必須機会の分割、所有session\/workerの終了確認、runnerの後続停止、計測前のimage\/容量preflightを修正。12種類のDB不要self-checkと構文・差分検査が通過。主文書216行。過去の全記録と105static\/48service、scale30本を保持。白紙all、所有者監査、proof、別セッションの最終Sol査読2役は未完了。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/author-revision18-verification.json\", \"results\/reviews\/author-revision18-protocol-preservation.json\", \"docs\/table-count-protocol-repair.md\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 19,\n        \"role\": \"integrate\",\n        \"summary\": \"author18の修正提出後、固定白紙allはRuby4.0.9でreset\/Compose起動まで進み容量確認でexit1。self-check\/初期整合\/全150要求\/最終verify未到達、summaryなし、ran=[]、lab_data_intact=false。文書だけ更新し前回exit130を履歴へ分離。容量項目を再開し、全指摘・全要求・過去観測を保持。source335件不変、proofと所有者監査・別Sol2査読は未完。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reference\/review-20261107T061530Z-94966\/manifest.json\", \"results\/reviews\/integrate-revision19-verification.json\", \"docs\/table-count-integration-audit.md\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 20,\n        \"role\": \"integrate\",\n        \"summary\": \"環境のみのretryはpreflight・12self-check・初期58COUNT照合・58shape・99lockへ到達。Sol wide2件の静的反例により所有者が基本負荷試験中に停止しexit130。8impactは部分診断のみ、150要求\/matrix\/最終verify未到達、summaryなし\/ran=[]\/lab_data_intact=false。primary\/replica停止とMEMORY揮発性を明記。service比較の採用根拠を限定し、新2finding\/2pure回帰要求を